            "turn_index": 5,
            "text": "The cultural center says the exhibition can be small—perhaps twenty items—and they are comfortable showing captions as provisional or including two versions of a story. They need a commitment in a month to reserve the spring slot. Tomas sees that flexibility as answering my concern. I feel relieved and also suspicious of my relief, because twenty items still create a frame. Whatever we choose becomes “our family” to strangers who will not see the rest."
